{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Presenting the Product"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Marketing Savvy"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le14ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Passive Voice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In English, sentence structure usually follows the same sequence: <span class=\"italic\">subject</span> + <span class=\"italic\">verb</span> + <span class=\"italic\">object</span>. The subject comes first and the object comes last. However, if you don't want to pay special attention to the subject, you can change the word order. One way of doing this is by using the passive voice to change the focus in a sentence.  <br></br>  The passive voice allows you talk about an event or action from the point of view of the thing or person affected. Sometimes you can write a sentence without even mentioning the agent (who or what was responsible for the action). "}, {"type": "text", "content": "This is how the passive is formed:  thing receiving action + be + past participle + (by) + (thing doing action)  <br></br> In informal spoken English, <span class=\"italic\">get</span> is sometimes used instead of<span class=\"italic\"> be </span>to form the passive. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The company's mission statement is <span class=\"underline\">revised</span> (OR: the company's mission statement gets revised)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The company's name <span class=\"underline\">is changed</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The company's logo is <span class=\"underline\">updated</span>. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "A new logo <span class=\"underline\">is chosen</span>  by a design firm. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "A marketing plan <span class=\"underline\">is created</span> to introduce the new look to stakeholders. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Future with \u201cWill\u201d, \u201cbe going to\u201d, Present Continuous and Present Simple"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">Will & Be Going To</span></br>  If something is planned to happen or it is likely to happen in the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span> (or be going to) before the base form of the verb.  <br></br>  <span class=\"underline\">Present Simple</span></br>  We use the Present Simple to talk about our thoughts and feelings at the present moment, or immediate reactions to something. You can also use it to talk about a settled state of affairs which includes the present moment. <br></br>   <span class=\"underline\"> Present Continuous</span> </br>  Use the Present Continuous to emphasize the present moment or to talk about changes, trends, or developments. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">This will help us hide malpractices of the past. </br>It will boost morale among us. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It is going to strengthen the team.</br>It is going to be aligned with our current views. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It addresses issues that are both internal and external.</br>It repositions the company in the current market. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are going to continue with our meeting for now.</br>We are integrating social responsibility in our business.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "numerous "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "many; lots"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The advantages of rebranding are numerous."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about rebranding."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "malpractice "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "illegal or dishonest behavior"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It will help hide malpractices of the past."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to strengthen"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make something more powerful or more effective"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is going to strengthen the team and will certainly improve pride among staff."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to reposition"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to change the way that customers see a product or company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It repositions the company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to align"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to change something in order to match it with something else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's going to be aligned with who they are and where they want to be."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "current trends"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the general direction in which things are changing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It will help us align with current trends in the market."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to roll out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to release a new product to the public for the first time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We've managed to roll out a number of new products."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le14ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and choose three famous but different logos from three separate companies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write five questions about the effectiveness, positive association, clarity or design of the logos. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show the logos to and ask at least four people the questions to find out which logo is the most effective."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write notes on their answers and see if there are conclusions to be drawn about the logos."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find three famous logos."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write five survey questions about the logos."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I show the logos and ask the questions to five different people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write notes on their responses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I draw conclusions about the survey results."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can explain facts and my point of view on work-related topics."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can exchange factual information and discuss future plans. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can give a supported argument about work-related processes that would benefit me and my employer. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Which companies have changed their logos recently?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What brands do you associate with quality? Luxury? Class?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "The Rebranding Stages"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " A <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">game-changing</span> decision."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type"